g in the lab so you probably  you'll probably go home and wonder  should I apply multi objective  optimization to my line of work so two  key features that you want to ask do you  have more than one objective that are  potentially conflicting and it when it  comes to decision space do you have full  control over the parameters so if  anybody's interested or has experience  I'll be in a pub I'll be glad to talk  about this or anything else a few  resources I find useful is anything that  a car's Itzler writes I wrote about this  this is his PhD he makes it really clear  again the developers of deep created a  great platform for quick prototyping and  just a community announcement we are  looking for an experience data engineer  if you yourself or you know anybody in  your network is looking for an  opportunity a great company that's  really looking to push the envelope in  discovering of therapeutic drugs then  please make connection so thank you  [Applause]
 

